      "writtenOn": "2022-03-23T23:38:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "While not always, having backlinks like this is usually a sign that something is wrong. You *can* do it due to Pin + Rc, but this also means that as long as a procedure is installed, the LinkManager can\u0027t actually be destroyed - there\u0027s a cycle since the LinkManager contains procedures which contain LinkContexts which reference the LinkManager.\n\nThis means that if the LinkManager gets \"deleted\" by C++ while a link is still active, it\u0027s now permanently active.",
      "revId": "7823b3a924c0dcc29ca9d28e832fa1aa062d3f97",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
