        "id": 1881539
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-25T14:50:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this case I need at least the Link to be shared between the Link Manager and a procedure, I could do that by putting each link on the heap and reference count them or assume that the whole LinkManager will be put inside a Rc.\n\nTo avoid the cycle here I changed the Rc inside the context into a Weak reference.",
      "parentUuid": "45e4fa6c_7a6cfe97",
      "revId": "7823b3a924c0dcc29ca9d28e832fa1aa062d3f97",
