      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-25T14:50:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure to understand what you are suggesting, are you proposing that I create an enum with 3 variant for these 3 packets and that I implement TryFrom on it ?\nOr that I create an `Either` that covers 3 variants ?",
      "parentUuid": "88d086b4_bab9952c",
